Upstream-Name: linuxmuster-squid
Upstream-Contact: Kevin Stenzel <mail@kevin-stenzel.de>
Source: https://github.com/faircomp/linuxmuster-squid
Comment: The binary package bundles third-party Python distributions from PyPI in the
 virtualenv under /opt/linuxmuster-squid/venv (the exact list and hashes are in
 controlplane/requirements.lock of the source). They keep their own licenses, which
 each distribution ships in its *.dist-info directory under
 /opt/linuxmuster-squid/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/. This file covers the
 package's own code.

